#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: sonoquill.php
msgid "Sonoquill – AI Podcast Production"
msgstr "Sonoquill – KI-Podcast-Produktion"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: sonoquill.php
msgid "https://github.com/benhartwich/sonoquill"
msgstr "https://github.com/benhartwich/sonoquill"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sonoquill.php
msgid ""
"Turns a fact script, a post or a custom source into a finished podcast "
"episode: speaking script via language model, number and fact checking, "
"speech synthesis with your own voice clone, assembly, mastering and a "
"Podlove draft — with two human approvals."
msgstr ""
"Macht aus einem Faktenskript, einem Beitrag oder einer eigenen Quelle eine "
"fertige Podcastfolge: Sprechskript per Sprachmodell, Zahlen- und "
"Faktenprüfung, Sprachsynthese mit dem eigenen Stimmklon, Montage, Mastering "
"und Podlove-Entwurf — mit zwei menschlichen Freigaben."

#. Author of the plugin
#: sonoquill.php
msgid "Benjamin Hartwich"
msgstr "Benjamin Hartwich"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: sonoquill.php
msgid "https://astroblog.org"
msgstr "https://astroblog.org"

